{"steam_appid":3714180,"steam_name":"Cropia","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3714180/192830412/db54b612b00cc95cf6ce2bcd38af90bc4d868264/1761641263/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761642401","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257210554/40d1298da3a5131329356ea2132849e5bb27d27b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761642401","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/92caef0fa8590782a8badc303fe13d15c2f49dda/ss_92caef0fa8590782a8badc303fe13d15c2f49dda.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786616929","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/c9ab4d149141638c86fa94e3ddf2b60aa7fec496/ss_c9ab4d149141638c86fa94e3ddf2b60aa7fec496.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786616929","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/1e36ac93c2a3aa6bdab45665b1714515d44391ba/ss_1e36ac93c2a3aa6bdab45665b1714515d44391ba.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786616929","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/932eec80d6bf281f31896667da967cc79ee19198/ss_932eec80d6bf281f31896667da967cc79ee19198.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786616929","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/4841bc421e6a58726816ecff15670756c619e804/ss_4841bc421e6a58726816ecff15670756c619e804.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786616929"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cropia, you settle in a peaceful countryside where fertile soil, lively wildlife, and a welcoming town await. You’ll build your own farm and ranch while contributing to the growth of the community around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌾 <strong>Farm &amp; Harvest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate fertile land with a variety of crops and watch your farm grow. Arrange your fields, expand your farmland, and create a space that reflects your own farming style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/50804ff7989a52aabe6b49ccdbd03931.poster.avif?t=1786616929\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/50804ff7989a52aabe6b49ccdbd03931.webm?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/50804ff7989a52aabe6b49ccdbd03931.mp4?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐑 <strong>Raise &amp; Care</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of animals ranging from chickens to larger livestock, ensuring they are fed and comfortable. In return, they provide valuable products and add life and charm to your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/2b3d0907196d8330b07ed7c63f30d80e.poster.avif?t=1786616929\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/2b3d0907196d8330b07ed7c63f30d80e.webm?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/2b3d0907196d8330b07ed7c63f30d80e.mp4?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎣 <strong>Go Fishing</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend time casting your line and experience the calm of fishing as you try to catch different kinds of fish. Each attempt brings the excitement of a new catch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/244b7adb0c56e1094584bfd8bddb5399.poster.avif?t=1786616929\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/244b7adb0c56e1094584bfd8bddb5399.webm?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/244b7adb0c56e1094584bfd8bddb5399.mp4?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⛏️ Mining</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mines to collect resources that are essential for crafting and upgrading your tools and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/6c6ee5744ed8345f73cd54cfa484c55b.poster.avif?t=1786616929\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/6c6ee5744ed8345f73cd54cfa484c55b.webm?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/6c6ee5744ed8345f73cd54cfa484c55b.mp4?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 <strong>Discover &amp; Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step outside your farm to stroll through forests, walk along the shore, or visit the bustling city. Take your time to enjoy the changing scenery and atmosphere as you explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/d3fd41506cbec77530ba9a689973cc75.poster.avif?t=1786616929\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/d3fd41506cbec77530ba9a689973cc75.webm?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/d3fd41506cbec77530ba9a689973cc75.mp4?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤝 <strong>Connect with the Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the townsfolk, each with their own unique personalities and needs. Build lasting friendships, sell goods, and become a valued part of the town’s daily life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/87f3f71ccce27c950afa7428af6e1d3e.poster.avif?t=1786616929\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/87f3f71ccce27c950afa7428af6e1d3e.webm?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/87f3f71ccce27c950afa7428af6e1d3e.mp4?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 1600 / Intel Core i5-8400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600 / Intel Core i7 7700K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 6GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>","genres":["Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Cropstone Studio"],"publishers":["Cropstone Studio"],"release_date":"13 Aug, 2026"}